  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coffee Production and Processing Reinforcement Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperative agreement for USADF Burundi Partner Association pour le Dveloppement Transformationnel des Communauts (DTC) to carry out year 3 of their cooperative agreement. Funds disbursed to provide liquidity in light of unanticipated shocks impacting project activities and grantee enterprises due to the COVID-19 pandemic. Funds to assist with project needs in light of fund shortage due to COVID-19.</narrative>
